635
01:05:54,409 --> 01:05:58,829
I don't know. In the woods.
I ran outside.

636
01:06:00,248 --> 01:06:02,082
Mommy, come get me.

637
01:06:02,250 --> 01:06:04,877
Abby, listen to me.
